# Spec 27: the right-click menu on a formula has "Copy LaTeX" (a toast says what was copied); a
# click on a picture or a diagram shows it zoomed over everything; a click or Esc closes it.
size 900 700
open zoom-copy.md
shot top.png
click 360 132 right
shot menu.png
click 402 148
shot copied.png
click 150 330
shot picture.png
click 450 650
click 450 440
shot diagram.png
keys esc
shot closed.png
